title: Start
---
Welcome to the experience machine. This is a video game based on philosophical dialogue. In this opening scene, we begin with a dialogue inspired by Plato's Phaedrus. In this dialogue, Plato gives his vision for public speaking, which he argues should be used only as a method for seeking truth. Additionally, towards the end, he warns against writing, warning the reader against the harm of relying too much on the written word lest one's faculties of memory become harmed.
    <<jump Socrates_Join

